title: Process Docs
abstract: "This repository contains the complete pipeline for processing and pre-publishing Lettres de Calvin (*Calvin's Letters*), a bilingual critical digital edition (French-Spanish) of John Calvin's French correspondence. The pipeline automates much of the editorial workflow while maintaining human oversight and control at critical stages."
